            "text": "`target:TakeDamage()` is called on `target`, an Instance chosen by the client. A type check such as `IsA` only proves what kind of object it is, not that the player owns it or may use it. Verify ownership or location before using the Instance: `inst:IsDescendantOf(player.Character)`, compare an `Owner` attribute with `player.UserId`, check the distance to the character, or look it up in a server-side list of allowed instances."
